@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊疗助理" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊疗助理接口</u>" as B0
actor "诊所负责人" as A1
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B1
control "<u>:登记采购验收与</u>\n<u>退换控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:采购</u>" as Purchase
participant "<u>:验收</u>" as Receipt
participant "<u>:验收项目</u>" as ReceiptItem
participant "<u>:采购差异</u>" as SupplyIssue
participant "<u>:批次存量</u>" as Stock
participant "<u>:采购项目</u>" as PurchaseItem
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-28办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-28办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Purchase : 核对到货依据(原采购10件及本次到货)
activate Purchase
Purchase --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Purchase
K -> Receipt : 登记本次验收(首次6件、合格5件、拒收1件)
activate Receipt
Receipt -> ReceiptItem : 核对数量组成(6等于5加1)
activate ReceiptItem
ReceiptItem --> Receipt : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate ReceiptItem
Receipt --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Receipt
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A1 -> B1 : 确认拒收差异及处理安排
activate B1
B1 -> B1 : 检查输入格式()
B1 -> K : 协调UC-28办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> SupplyIssue : 保留验收差异(拒收1件及补换安排)
activate SupplyIssue
SupplyIssue --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplyIssue
end
K --> B1 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B1 --> A1 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B1
A0 -> B0 : 提交已确认验收入库
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-28办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Stock : 接收合格入库(仅合格5件)
activate Stock
Stock --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Stock
K -> Purchase : 更新履行进度(再到4件并合格后的累计)
activate Purchase
Purchase -> PurchaseItem : 核对交付及差异(到货10、合格9、拒收待处理\n1)
activate PurchaseItem
PurchaseItem --> Purchase : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PurchaseItem
Purchase --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Purchase
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,PurchaseItem
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
